VALUES ('HotspotInteraction', 'Hotspot Interaction', 'A hotspot interaction is a graphical interaction with a corresponding set of choices that are defined as areas of the graphic image. The candidate''s task is to select one or more of the areas (hotspots). The hotspot interaction should only be used when the spatial relationship of the choices with respect to each other (as represented by the graphic image) is important to the needs of the item. Otherwise, choiceInteraction should be used instead with separate material for each option.', 6.00) END
ELSE IF @updateExisting = 1 BEGIN UPDATE dbo.[RefApipInteractionType] 
SET [Description] = 'Hotspot Interaction', [Definition] = 'A hotspot interaction is a graphical interaction with a corresponding set of choices that are defined as areas of the graphic image. The candidate''s task is to select one or more of the areas (hotspots). The hotspot interaction should only be used when the spatial relationship of the choices with respect to each other (as represented by the graphic image) is important to the needs of the item. Otherwise, choiceInteraction should be used instead with separate material for each option.', [SortOrder] = 6.00 WHERE [Code] = 'HotspotInteraction'  END
