VALUES ('Temporarilyrestrictednetassets', 'Temporarily restricted net assets', 'Used for reporting net assets that are subject to a donor’s or grantor’s restriction are restricted net assets. Include long-term but temporarily restricted net assets, such as term endowments, and net assets held subject to trust agreements if those agreements permit expenditure of the resources at a future date. (FARM para. 450.3)', NULL) END
